{"id":1050901,"chapter_id":1050901,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"N.F.115年 某月某日\n\n上午10点30分\n\nMBCC管理局，走廊","style":9,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"小文","content":"哟～你要找局长吗？他刚开完早会，应该回办公室休息了。","female_content":"哟～你要找局长吗？她刚开完早会，应该回办公室休息了。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_5","vo_trial_50901_1_5f"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"尤金","content":"哦这样……局长把便携终端落在食堂了，阿姨让我帮忙送过来。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"小文","content":"咦——没想到局长也会丢三落四……说来最近看他脸色不太好，老打瞌睡，该不会晚上没睡好吧？","female_content":"咦——没想到局长也会丢三落四……说来最近看她脸色不太好，老打瞌睡，该不会晚上没睡好吧？","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_7","vo_trial_50901_1_7f"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"小文","content":"是通宵打电动吗？还是追剧……？","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"尤金","content":"别把局长想得跟你一样吧……","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"你们在聊什么？","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"小文","content":"夜莺副官！我们刚在聊局长的事儿，最近他看起来身体不太好，我们要不要给攒点补气血的保健品呢。","female_content":"夜莺副官！我们刚在聊局长的事儿，最近她看起来身体不太好，我们要不要给攒点补气血的保健品呢。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_11","vo_trial_50901_1_11f"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"小文","content":"今天早会我特意数了，他一共打了19个哈欠，走神了2次，签字的时候还签错了地方。","female_content":"今天早会我特意数了，她一共打了19个哈欠，走神了2次，签字的时候还签错了地方。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_12","vo_trial_50901_1_12f"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"尤金","content":"——吃早餐的时候还落下了终端。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"明白了。终端交给我，你们去忙自己的事吧。局长最近确实有点疲惫，我已经给他在医务室挂了号了。","female_content":"明白了。终端交给我，你们去忙自己的事吧。局长最近确实有点疲惫，我已经给她在医务室挂了号了。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_14","vo_trial_50901_1_14f"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"至于是开保健品还是休假条，让我们交给医师判断吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"小文","content":"不愧是副官！那局长和他的终端就拜托你，我们先走啦～","female_content":"不愧是副官！那局长和她的终端就拜托你，我们先走啦～","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_16","vo_trial_50901_1_16f"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"小文拉着尤金离开了走廊。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"…………唉。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，我进来了。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"推开门，夜莺见到${PlayerName}正在桌前闭目养神，眼下有淡淡的黑眼圈。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901018,"trial_step":18},{"step":18,"content":"她把终端放在桌上，离开前，顺势端详了一下桌上的紫藤花枝。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901019,"trial_step":19},{"step":19,"content":"那个冬夜中疯狂生长的紫藤灾厄平息后，局长将一株从狂厄紫藤上取下的花枝带了回来。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901020,"trial_step":20},{"step":20,"content":"如今它插在桌上的花盆之中，比起之前的灰黑枯瘦，已经萌发出了好几片细小嫩芽。刚刚浇过水的露珠还缀在叶尖，晶莹可爱。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901021,"trial_step":21},{"step":21,"content":"——散发出淡淡的狂厄气息。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901022,"trial_step":22},{"step":22,"content":"与此同时——","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901023,"trial_step":23},{"step":23,"content":"你已经在这片雾茫茫的梦境中走了一阵子，这一次路途格外的远。也许是从MBCC到狂厄紫藤残骸之间的距离吧，大概？","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901025,"trial_step":25},{"step":24,"content":"而牵动着你、指引着你的，便是眼前的那一朵悠悠飘荡的紫藤花。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901026,"trial_step":26},{"step":25,"content":"【场景，紫藤树下】","style":18,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901027,"trial_step":27},{"step":26,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"小郎君，你又来看我啦。","female_content":"小女娘，你又来看我啦。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_35","vo_trial_50901_1_35f"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901028,"trial_step":28},{"step":27,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"一路走来，有没有感觉这片地方变大了些？","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901029,"trial_step":29},{"step":28,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"我在这儿太无聊了，就试着比划还原了一下之前狄斯城的样子——照你跟我说的那样。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901030,"trial_step":30},{"step":29,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"像这样一砖一瓦地砌起来，还挺耗时间的呢。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901031,"trial_step":31},{"step":30,"options":["让你久等了"],"style":6,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901032,"trial_step":32,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"让你久等了","goto":33}]},{"step":31,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"不会呀，我一边想，一边造，过程中再想想你在哪些地方逞了什么英雄……呵呵，怪有意思的。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901033,"trial_step":33},{"step":32,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"等你好了，我们出去看实景，玩真的。","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901034,"trial_step":34},{"step":33,"content":"说到这儿，你想了想，撸起袖子伸出手。","style":3,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901035,"trial_step":35},{"step":34,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"来都来了，不整点加餐吗？","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901036,"trial_step":36},{"step":35,"content":"这是你们之间的默契。","style":3,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901037,"trial_step":37},{"step":36,"content":"自紫藤暴走以来，萦萦本体还在那片狂厄废墟中，难以彻底剥离。她非常虚弱，全靠无患子的治疗、还有稳定装置才能维持生命，却始终无法真正复苏。","style":3,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901038,"trial_step":38},{"step":37,"content":"你将那株新发的幼苗带回局子，也只能偶尔在梦中见见她，聊聊天。梦里听她说“自己越来越好”，醒来却只能看报告上的“毫无进展”。","style":3,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901039,"trial_step":39},{"step":38,"content":"一段时间过后，你终究还是寄希望于故事里的野路子——由人提供元气，修复她的生命。这么胡来的事儿，也只能你自己偷偷做了。","style":3,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901040,"trial_step":40},{"step":39,"content":"反正通过枷锁，你们两人也算有些联系了，每天渡给她一点，也确实看出了效果。","style":3,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901041,"trial_step":41},{"step":40,"content":"——只不过进度很慢，慢得让人不安。","style":3,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901042,"trial_step":42},{"step":41,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"来，花神大人。您的信徒来上供品了。","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901043,"trial_step":43},{"step":42,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"……………………","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901044,"trial_step":44},{"step":43,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"还是算了吧，我有无患子妹妹照顾呢，用不着。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901045,"trial_step":45},{"step":44,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"她常来看我，给紫藤树扎针，也都告诉我了。人家游医都说了，那什么${PlayerName}居士今天又打了多少瞌睡，摔了好几跤。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901046,"trial_step":46},{"step":45,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"这么下去一个没捞回来，还搭进去另一个，啧啧啧……","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901047,"trial_step":47},{"step":46,"content":"萦萦嗔怪似的看你，气哼哼地伸手戳你的脸。","style":3,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901048,"trial_step":48},{"step":47,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"都说了，感觉不舒服的时候，你要随时制止我，你还想骗我说没事？","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901049,"trial_step":49},{"step":48,"content":"你刚想开口，就被她的这句话堵了回来。","style":3,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901050,"trial_step":50},{"step":49,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"你想说，多休息几天就好了，让我尽快恢复比较重要。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901051,"trial_step":51},{"step":50,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"可是，你对我也很重要。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901052,"trial_step":52},{"step":51,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"所以，今天我们就换一种形式吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901053,"trial_step":53},{"step":52,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"我观察着无患子妹妹的手法，学会了一手正宗东洲推拿，舒筋活络养血安神，来帮你恢复健康吧～！就当是感谢你为我输血的回报～！","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901054,"trial_step":54},{"step":53,"content":"她一边说一边活动活动手腕，一副要大干一场的架势。","style":3,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901055,"trial_step":55},{"step":54,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"就当你给了我那么多元气的回报，也要让我找机会报答一下。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901056,"trial_step":56},{"step":55,"options":["无患子还给树做推拿呢？","能不能轻点？"],"style":6,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901057,"trial_step":57,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"无患子还给树做推拿呢？","goto":58},{"text":"能不能轻点？","goto":59}]},{"step":56,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"哎呀你又想那么多，不要在意细节，来吧来吧～","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901058,"trial_step":58,"next":[60]},{"step":57,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"那可不行，得用力才会有效果。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901059,"trial_step":59,"next":[60]},{"step":58,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"交给我，你就好好享·受·吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901060,"trial_step":60},{"step":59,"content":"【黑屏】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901061,"trial_step":61},{"step":60,"content":"你被萦萦推到铺满紫藤花的树下躺好，近日的疲惫便宛如海浪般席卷而来。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901062,"trial_step":62},{"step":61,"content":"每一次前来探望萦萦，你都将大部分元气给了她，无患子警告过几次，但你觉得自己还能扛。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901063,"trial_step":63},{"step":62,"content":"但一躺下来，身体的每一处肌肉与关节都在对你发出抗议。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901064,"trial_step":64},{"step":63,"content":"好几朵紫藤花落到了你的眼睑上，视野蒙上似梦非幻的淡紫色。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901065,"trial_step":65},{"step":64,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"那我开始咯。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901066,"trial_step":66},{"step":65,"content":"她的手指顺着你的脸颊上滑，在眉间轻点了点，便滑到了脑后。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901067,"trial_step":67},{"step":66,"content":"她动作轻柔，摁压准确，在关键穴道用力摁压时，传来的不是疼痛，而是说不出的酸麻。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901068,"trial_step":68},{"step":67,"content":"不知不觉间全身都放松了下来。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901069,"trial_step":69},{"step":68,"content":"很柔和。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901070,"trial_step":70},{"step":69,"content":"很温暖的感觉。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901071,"trial_step":71},{"step":70,"content":"在身上游走的手指触感，却渐渐变得放肆起来，先是头顶，然后是肩膀，再来是背部、腰，以及——","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901072,"trial_step":72},{"step":71,"content":"手指经过的地方，温柔的暖流从指尖传递到身体。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901073,"trial_step":73},{"step":72,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……？","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901074,"trial_step":74},{"step":73,"options":["出声","忍住"],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901075,"trial_step":75,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"出声","goto":76},{"text":"忍住","goto":77}]},{"step":74,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"等等！","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901076,"trial_step":76,"next":[77]},{"step":75,"content":"你的身体变得很轻。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901077,"trial_step":77},{"step":76,"content":"伴随着从她指尖传递来的熟悉能量，你的元气迅速恢复。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901078,"trial_step":78},{"step":77,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你等一下——","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901079,"trial_step":79},{"step":78,"content":"【黑屏结束】","style":18,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901080,"trial_step":80},{"step":79,"content":"你翻身坐起，一把抓住了萦萦的手。","style":3,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901081,"trial_step":81},{"step":80,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"为什么要把元气还给我？","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901082,"trial_step":82},{"step":81,"content":"面对你的质问，她却趁势与你十指相扣，将你重新摁倒在紫藤花丛中。","style":3,"background":2377,"log_type":1,"src_id":150901083,"trial_step":83},{"step":82,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"因为有人照顾不好自己，只能由我来帮忙照顾了呀。","voice":["vo_trial_50901_1_94"],"voice_bank":"v